libvips 8.18 branch after 8.18.7, commit 08c6756d5aa6:
https://github.com/libvips/libvips/commit/08c6756d5aa651da5cd66c8a23c36e7ac32960c0

gifload (libnsgif) of an animated GIF with several pages (n=-1): the frame
height times the number of frames went unchecked into the size of the output
image and could overflow it; now the frame size and the total height are
checked against VIPS_MAX_COORD ("image too large").

